"""Approximate the component's response to unusual typography.

Curly quotes/apostrophes give negative activations. Their quote-role amplitude
is divided by sqrt(1 + earlier weighted quote marks): curly marks count 1,
straight single marks count 0.2. Recent Han text weakens opening double quotes.
Additional rules cover tabs, special spaces, dashes, ligatures and fullwidth
forms; other tokens get zero. State resets at document boundaries.
